      "semanticDecision": "Meaning and natural Russian are clean. The male player finds one blue bell, wonders about its purpose, and receives a tentative suggestion to ring that bell at the perch. Singular informal ты, the item count, насест, and hint direction are retained. The body correctly avoids naming Penny or revealing the lake-travel function before the source does.",
