    {
      "groupId": "swim-first-page-body",
      "origin": "new-whole-group",
      "decision": "clean",
      "source": "You got the Swim Floaties!\r\n\rNow nothing can stop you!\r\nOr, at least, calm waters can’t stop you…",
      "target": "Ты получил надувные нарукавники!\n\nТеперь тебя ничто не остановит!\nНу, по крайней мере, спокойная вода тебя не остановит…",
      "semanticDecision": "Meaning and natural Russian are clean. The male player receives the approved plural надувные нарукавники. The boast that nothing can stop him and the humorous qualification about calm water both remain; no unrestricted swimming ability is promised. Ты получил and тебя retain informal singular address.",
