      "groupId": "swim-second-page-body",
      "origin": "new-whole-group",
      "decision": "clean",
      "source": "Rascal will automatically equip certain items when they’re needed.\r\n\r\nThis is one of them. \r\nJust walk next to water and watch him do the rest!\r\n\r\nHe’ll only swim in areas with calmer water.\r\n",
      "target": "Некоторые вещи Плут надевает сам, когда они ему нужны.\n\nНарукавники — одни из них.\nПросто подойди к воде, а дальше он справится сам!\n\nПлавать он будет только в местах со спокойной водой.",
      "semanticDecision": "Meaning and natural Russian are clean. Плут remains the male automatic-equipment actor, certain items are equipped when needed, and the floaties are explicitly one such item type. The player only approaches the water; Плут does the rest himself. Только keeps the restriction to calmer/calm water. Russian plural Нарукавники — одни из них is grammatical agreement with the plural item name, not an added quantity.",
